<title>INDIA: 31 die as bus plunges into Indian river.</title>
<headline>31 die as bus plunges into Indian river.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>About 31 people died and eight were injured when a bus on its way to a wedding plunged into a river in the western desert state of Rajasthan on Wednesday, the Press Trust of India (PTI) news agency reported.</p>
